"""
Mycodelab-lab profile generator.
Builds three animated SVGs for the profile README:
  name.svg     - LED-matrix name banner (decrypt + glitch)
  terminal.svg - neofetch-style terminal with live GitHub stats
  skills.svg   - animated skill tiles with logos
Runs daily from GitHub Actions to refresh the stats.
"""
